Package: fastrel
Type: Package
Title: Fast Relatedness, Relationship and Kinship Matrices from Pedigrees
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Alexandre", "Courtiol", email = "alexandre.courtiol@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0637-2959"))
  )
Description: Computes quickly the main measures of identity by descent
    between the diploid individuals of a pedigree. The computation uses the
    tabular method of Emik and Terrill (1949)
    <doi:10.1093/oxfordjournals.jhered.a105986>, implemented in C++. The
    measures can also be updated incrementally as individuals are born, die or
    migrate, to save much computational time in individual-based simulations.
